WEBVTT

00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:02.274
TOKYO STATION

00:00:02.644 --> 00:00:05.044
Jeez... Your necktie's crooked.

00:00:06.014 --> 00:00:07.684
There. Okay!

00:00:07.684 --> 00:00:11.854
Now my dad and mom will
approve of the two of us.

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:12.854
Approve of what?!

00:00:12.854 --> 00:00:14.454
You're not going to get engaged!

00:00:14.454 --> 00:00:17.454
Minamoto's just on a business trip to Kyoto!

00:00:17.454 --> 00:00:19.864
Why don't you just teleport home?

00:00:19.864 --> 00:00:21.914
I'm not wasting a chance to get
some time alone with him.

00:00:22.464 --> 00:00:25.534
I'll be back in two or three days,
so be good till then.

00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:28.524
You'll have Kashiwagi and Sakaki to
help if there's anything you need.

00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:30.294
Aye, aye.

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:32.574
Then let's go, Mr. Minamoto!

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:34.004
NOZOMI 10708:00 New Osaka
HIKARI 36308:03 Okayama
NOZOMI 1108:10 Hiroshi

00:00:45.114 --> 00:00:48.784
Stupid Aoi... She knows they don't need
her back home for anything this week.

00:00:48.784 --> 00:00:51.814
Well, we know how she feels, so let's
give her a break on this, okay?

00:00:52.464 --> 00:00:59.554
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:00.564 --> 00:01:06.434
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:08.874 --> 00:01:14.674
Meeting you like I did

00:01:15.014 --> 00:01:19.884
Wasn't just so we could live

00:01:21.154 --> 00:01:26.684
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:01:27.094 --> 00:01:31.694
And surely change the future

00:01:32.294 --> 00:01:35.204
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:01:35.204 --> 00:01:38.334
Is released (changing yourself)

00:01:38.474 --> 00:01:44.204
An angel's shining surges through me

00:01:45.644 --> 00:01:48.214
The "wings" that will save the world

00:01:48.214 --> 00:01:51.044
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:01:51.284 --> 00:01:57.454
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:01:57.594 --> 00:02:00.394
The power given to me

00:02:00.394 --> 00:02:03.034
Spurs me into the sky

00:02:03.034 --> 00:02:08.764
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:09.104 --> 00:02:14.634
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:02:23.754 --> 00:02:24.514
31st sense: "World Heritage!
C'mon, Shall We Go To Kyoto?"

00:02:24.514 --> 00:02:25.824
31st sense: "World Heritage!
C'mon, Shall We Go To Kyoto?"
By the way, why do we have reserved seats?

00:02:25.824 --> 00:02:26.304
By the way, why do we have reserved seats?

00:02:26.554 --> 00:02:29.054
The Chief's doing, because you're with me.

00:02:29.054 --> 00:02:31.954
It was all I could do to keep him
from reserving the whole train.

00:02:31.954 --> 00:02:34.484
We could do general seating and
then split the difference...

00:02:36.264 --> 00:02:38.794
Then it'd be more cramped
and we'd get shoved closer.

00:02:38.794 --> 00:02:42.594
I was really looking forward to
having you to myself today.

00:02:43.004 --> 00:02:45.594
When do I ever get to go to my home
town with just the two of us!

00:02:46.944 --> 00:02:47.774
Aoi...

00:02:49.214 --> 00:02:50.234
Mr. Minamoto...

00:02:50.544 --> 00:02:52.374
Just the two of us? You're wrong there.

00:02:53.014 --> 00:02:55.204
Oh! Here you are!

00:02:55.784 --> 00:02:57.544
The Shinkansen is so long!

00:02:57.614 --> 00:03:01.484
I got on in the first car and it
took forever to walk back here!

00:03:01.484 --> 00:03:04.054
But now I know every detail
of the Shinkansen's interior!

00:03:04.054 --> 00:03:05.094
Hi, Ken.

00:03:05.094 --> 00:03:06.424
Sorry for the wait.

00:03:07.864 --> 00:03:12.094
What are you doing here?!
You're totally in the way!

00:03:12.194 --> 00:03:15.064
Why? I'm going to Kyoto too,
for my own mission!

00:03:15.234 --> 00:03:17.864
And my job is to show him around.

00:03:18.334 --> 00:03:22.074
Great. Having this clown along
will shoot the mood to hell.

00:03:22.244 --> 00:03:24.044
Goodbye, my adventure...

00:03:24.744 --> 00:03:25.774
By the way, Ken...

00:03:25.774 --> 00:03:26.504
What?

00:03:26.984 --> 00:03:28.774
Why are you just wearing socks?

00:03:29.254 --> 00:03:31.414
Oh! Leave this to me!

00:03:31.414 --> 00:03:34.754
This time, I was sure to study
up on Japanese culture.

00:03:35.784 --> 00:03:38.654
And you thought you had to take off your
shoes before getting on a train?

00:03:38.654 --> 00:03:40.684
Nobody does that anymore.

00:03:42.224 --> 00:03:43.594
WHAT?!

00:03:44.764 --> 00:03:47.024
A-Activate clairvoyance!

00:03:56.374 --> 00:03:57.844
Why are there shoes here?

00:03:57.844 --> 00:03:58.944
Dunno.

00:03:58.944 --> 00:04:01.384
KYOTO

00:04:02.584 --> 00:04:03.844
I'm home!

00:04:05.114 --> 00:04:07.744
Sis! Welcome back!

00:04:08.224 --> 00:04:10.294
Why? Isn't this house made
of wood and bamboo?!
How do you do, Yuuki?

00:04:10.294 --> 00:04:12.224
Why? Isn't this house made
of wood and bamboo?!

00:04:14.094 --> 00:04:16.024
Why? Why?

00:04:19.034 --> 00:04:21.554
- Always with Sis. - Foreigner.
- Clingy. - Idiot.
- Gentleman.
DANGEROUS SAFE

00:04:21.934 --> 00:04:23.304
HEE-YA!

00:04:23.474 --> 00:04:25.264
Welcome home, Sis!

00:04:26.274 --> 00:04:27.604
Nice to meet you!

00:04:27.604 --> 00:04:28.704
How do you do?

00:04:30.914 --> 00:04:32.314
Hey! Yuuki!

00:04:32.844 --> 00:04:34.684
Ow! Sis, that hurts!

00:04:34.684 --> 00:04:36.054
Oh, my!

00:04:36.054 --> 00:04:37.184
Mom!

00:04:37.184 --> 00:04:39.654
Mr. Minamoto, I presume. Welcome to our home.

00:04:39.654 --> 00:04:42.054
I wasn't expecting you to come here together.

00:04:42.324 --> 00:04:44.954
Oh! Pardon me barging in like this!

00:04:44.954 --> 00:04:47.954
I'm here on business, so I'll be leaving soon.

00:04:48.224 --> 00:04:51.164
No point in wasting a visit.
Come in, by all means.

00:04:51.164 --> 00:04:54.304
My husband's home, too. Dear?

00:04:54.304 --> 00:04:56.824
I knew. Aoi emailed me about him.

00:04:57.234 --> 00:04:58.234
Dad?

00:04:58.234 --> 00:04:59.794
Oh, she did?

00:05:00.004 --> 00:05:03.634
It said "Coming to visit with my honey."

00:05:05.274 --> 00:05:09.214
Aoi is only ten! You'll have
her over my dead body!

00:05:09.214 --> 00:05:11.874
Oh! Japanese samurai!

00:05:12.554 --> 00:05:14.924
Don't take a child's joke so seriously!

00:05:14.924 --> 00:05:16.654
Stop hurting my honey, Dad!

00:05:17.024 --> 00:05:19.894
Oh! The residents are typical Kyoto people!

00:05:20.664 --> 00:05:23.854
Oh! Well, why didn't you say so?

00:05:24.064 --> 00:05:26.724
I just assumed the worst.

00:05:27.034 --> 00:05:29.594
My husband's from Osaka, so he
tends to be a bit headstrong.

00:05:29.734 --> 00:05:33.274
Actually, I don't think being from
Kyoto or Osaka was the problem here...

00:05:33.274 --> 00:05:35.044
Here, Mr. Minamoto. Tea for you.

00:05:35.044 --> 00:05:35.734
Thank you.

00:05:36.914 --> 00:05:38.034
Here. Tea rice.

00:05:38.374 --> 00:05:41.404
Wow! Are you treating me special?

00:05:42.214 --> 00:05:45.914
Actually, in Kyoto, getting this
is code for "Get lost, please."

00:05:45.914 --> 00:05:48.254
Oh, you shouldn't tell lies.

00:05:48.254 --> 00:05:50.784
Why serve lunch to someone you want to go?

00:05:51.394 --> 00:05:54.964
Mr. Minamoto, you've been taking
such good care of our daughter.

00:05:54.964 --> 00:05:56.754
Along with Kaoru and Shiho.

00:05:56.934 --> 00:06:00.964
Oh no, Aoi helps me just as much.

00:06:00.964 --> 00:06:03.194
She's a smart, gentle girl.

00:06:03.834 --> 00:06:07.534
She's the most reliable of the three.
I'm always grateful to her.

00:06:07.974 --> 00:06:09.064
Mr. Minamoto...

00:06:09.444 --> 00:06:13.344
Really? You really think of me like that?

00:06:13.344 --> 00:06:14.684
I'm so happy!

00:06:14.684 --> 00:06:15.514
Really.

00:06:15.914 --> 00:06:19.284
Although I am laying it on a little
thick in front of your parents.

00:06:19.284 --> 00:06:22.014
Oh! Quit teasing me, Mr. Minamoto!

00:06:23.094 --> 00:06:24.454
Have some tea rice.

00:06:25.154 --> 00:06:28.164
Wow! Yours is even bigger than mine!

00:06:28.164 --> 00:06:31.424
So, anyway... Duty calls! Let's go, Ken!

00:06:31.964 --> 00:06:35.264
Oh yeah, what sort of mission is it? Can I help?

00:06:35.264 --> 00:06:37.134
Oh! You're a lifesaver!

00:06:37.134 --> 00:06:39.304
Hey! She's here on vacation!

00:06:39.304 --> 00:06:42.364
I'd feel better having a teleporter
who's familiar with the locale.

00:06:43.374 --> 00:06:47.384
We may need her to protect
this city from that man.

00:06:47.384 --> 00:06:48.744
KINPAKU-JI

00:06:48.744 --> 00:06:50.114
KOU-JI

00:06:50.114 --> 00:06:51.554
KYOMIZU TEMPLE

00:06:53.954 --> 00:06:57.544
We're like a grown-up couple on
vacation on Suspense Theater.

00:06:57.654 --> 00:06:58.624
Really?

00:06:59.524 --> 00:07:02.124
Is this all of Kyoto's historic sights?

00:07:02.124 --> 00:07:04.194
We haven't even visited half of them yet.

00:07:04.194 --> 00:07:08.234
There are 17 places in Kyoto
designated as world heritage sites.

00:07:08.234 --> 00:07:10.034
Seventeen?! Really?!

00:07:10.704 --> 00:07:13.294
Does the mission today have something
to do with world heritage?

00:07:13.644 --> 00:07:16.764
A nasty esper criminal has
apparently entered the country.

00:07:20.114 --> 00:07:21.634
Clyde Barrow?

00:07:21.914 --> 00:07:26.044
Yes, a Comerican from New York
and self-described "artist."

00:07:26.454 --> 00:07:28.924
He's a teleportation-based combo power user.

00:07:28.924 --> 00:07:31.914
We received a request from him to join PANDRA.

00:07:34.294 --> 00:07:35.384
You did it!

00:07:36.934 --> 00:07:40.504
And I win yet again!
Kyosuke, you really suck at this!

00:07:40.504 --> 00:07:43.204
My hands just aren't used to working
these simplistic controls!

00:07:43.204 --> 00:07:44.904
You mean you don't have my perseverance?

00:07:44.904 --> 00:07:47.504
Shut up, rodent! One more game!

00:07:47.504 --> 00:07:49.204
You can't win, no matter how many we play.

00:07:49.204 --> 00:07:50.444
Shut up! You're just lucky!

00:07:50.444 --> 00:07:52.464
Um... Major?
Okay, let's do this!

00:07:52.944 --> 00:07:57.444
Clyde likes to travel around destroying
world heritage sites for fun.

00:07:57.954 --> 00:08:01.354
The Comerican government has been pursuing
him as a matter of national pride.

00:08:01.354 --> 00:08:03.254
For national pride, and they just sent you?

00:08:03.254 --> 00:08:08.124
The CIA predicts there's only a 7%
chance of him appearing in Kyoto.

00:08:08.124 --> 00:08:09.834
Long story, short, it's pretty low.

00:08:09.834 --> 00:08:13.034
Mary and the others have gone to
places with higher probabilities.

00:08:13.034 --> 00:08:16.334
So, our job is to be on patrol, just in case.

00:08:16.334 --> 00:08:21.034
And if anything happens, Director
Tsubomi will come here to aid us.

00:08:22.044 --> 00:08:24.674
So, we can be more relaxed about this.

00:08:24.674 --> 00:08:24.714
KYOTO TOWER
So, we can be more relaxed about this.

00:08:24.714 --> 00:08:27.144
KYOTO TOWER

00:08:28.044 --> 00:08:30.014
It's a lovely city, isn't it, Clyde?

00:08:30.014 --> 00:08:33.854
Yes... But I can make it so much
lovelier, don't you think, Bonnie?

00:08:33.854 --> 00:08:35.324
With my hands.

00:08:35.324 --> 00:08:36.884
Clyde, you're wonderful!

00:08:37.224 --> 00:08:42.624
Looks like PANDRA's working to lower the
prediction accuracy in order to welcome me.

00:08:44.134 --> 00:08:45.094
You did it!

00:08:45.564 --> 00:08:47.834
Yay! I win again!

00:08:50.104 --> 00:08:51.274
M-Major...

00:08:51.274 --> 00:08:54.704
Shut up! Don't talk to me now! One more time!

00:08:54.704 --> 00:08:56.514
It's gonna end the same,
no matter how many times you do it.

00:08:56.514 --> 00:08:59.874
Don't be a smartass!
Now I'll show you my true power!
After all that work to jam the prediction system...

00:09:00.144 --> 00:09:02.344
Since odds are low that he'll
be showing up in Kyoto

00:09:02.344 --> 00:09:02.784
TONICHI BRIDGE
Since odds are low that he'll
be showing up in Kyoto

00:09:02.784 --> 00:09:04.254
TONICHI BRIDGE
let's just relax like this and have fun!

00:09:04.254 --> 00:09:04.584
let's just relax like this and have fun!

00:09:04.584 --> 00:09:07.174
Oh! A man-powered car! A rickshaw!

00:09:07.384 --> 00:09:09.444
Let me on! I want to sit on it, too!

00:09:10.294 --> 00:09:13.694
And over there's a restaurant that serves
Kyoto cuisine to even first time customers.

00:09:13.694 --> 00:09:17.284
Hey! We're not here to sightsee!
Be serious about this!

00:09:17.564 --> 00:09:20.764
You're a workaholic.
Japanese people work too hard.

00:09:21.064 --> 00:09:24.234
Aoi, you don't have to come with us. Go home!

00:09:25.334 --> 00:09:27.574
There's no point in you tagging along with us.

00:09:27.574 --> 00:09:29.944
Oh... No point, huh?

00:09:30.214 --> 00:09:32.444
Fine, then just call me when you need me!

00:09:32.444 --> 00:09:34.674
I'll just be in the way otherwise, right?!

00:09:34.914 --> 00:09:38.654
Huh? No, that's not what
I meant... You're on leave, so...

00:09:38.654 --> 00:09:41.584
And you don't want to see my
face when I'm on leave, right?!

00:09:42.624 --> 00:09:44.024
Don't start crying.

00:09:44.024 --> 00:09:46.514
Mr. Minamoto, you're a poop-head!

00:09:47.424 --> 00:09:48.994
You idiot!

00:09:48.994 --> 00:09:51.264
Hey! How am I supposed to get out of this?!

00:09:51.264 --> 00:09:52.494
I'm all tied up!

00:09:52.494 --> 00:09:55.404
Man... You made a girl cry.

00:09:55.404 --> 00:09:59.164
Don't say it like it's my fault!
You both went overboard!

00:09:59.404 --> 00:10:03.214
Sorry! It's my first time in Kyoto, so I'm excited.

00:10:03.214 --> 00:10:05.144
But why is she so excited?

00:10:07.014 --> 00:10:10.604
I was really looking forward to
having you to myself today.

00:10:11.014 --> 00:10:13.614
When do I ever get to go to my home
town with just the two of us!

00:10:16.394 --> 00:10:19.684
It was for you, and look how
you spoke to that poor girl!

00:10:19.994 --> 00:10:22.294
God, why are girls so?!

00:10:23.034 --> 00:10:24.264
Gonna just leave it?

00:10:24.264 --> 00:10:28.204
Of course! I don't have time
to deal with a selfish child!

00:10:30.574 --> 00:10:34.004
But if it bugs you that much,
I'll send her an email.

00:10:34.144 --> 00:10:37.944
Clairvoyance! I see him! He's in Kyoto!

00:10:37.944 --> 00:10:38.774
What?

00:10:38.774 --> 00:10:40.484
In the mountains to the northeast!

00:10:40.484 --> 00:10:41.944
I see some sort of drawing!

00:10:42.114 --> 00:10:45.414
A picture, like a manga. Sumo-wrestling lizards!

00:10:45.584 --> 00:10:48.214
The Dinosaur Cartoon!
Our national treasure! Kousan temple?!

00:10:48.784 --> 00:10:49.554
What's wrong?

00:10:49.554 --> 00:10:51.294
He's drawing something on it!

00:10:51.294 --> 00:10:52.584
He's defacing the Dinosaur Cartoon?!

00:10:52.694 --> 00:10:53.394
CLYDE WAS HERE

00:10:53.394 --> 00:10:55.364
CLYDE WAS HERE
And it's very, very terrible!

00:10:55.694 --> 00:10:57.664
How dare he do that for fun!

00:10:58.434 --> 00:10:59.094
Now what?!

00:10:59.094 --> 00:10:59.134
CLYDE WAS HERE
Now what?!

00:10:59.134 --> 00:10:59.494
CLYDE WAS HERE

00:10:59.494 --> 00:11:01.634
CLYDE WAS HERE
There's graffiti all over the rooftop!

00:11:01.634 --> 00:11:02.964
There's graffiti all over the rooftop!

00:11:03.174 --> 00:11:04.534
The roof of Tenchu temple?!

00:11:04.534 --> 00:11:08.474
He's going to make Japanese mad
at all Comericans for this!

00:11:12.914 --> 00:11:16.714
ESP Support Lab BABEL... Oh! Minamoto!

00:11:17.614 --> 00:11:20.854
Hello! Hotaru, here. What's up, Minamoto?

00:11:20.854 --> 00:11:23.014
Give me a priority line to Director Tsubomi, now!

00:11:28.164 --> 00:11:30.864
Director! Please get up!

00:11:30.864 --> 00:11:32.094
Director!

00:11:32.094 --> 00:11:34.094
It's an emergency!

00:11:34.504 --> 00:11:37.194
Screw it. Later!

00:11:37.304 --> 00:11:41.244
This isn't what she promised!
Did she forget she was my backup?!

00:11:41.244 --> 00:11:44.444
Even if they hurry, the Comerican
esper team is an hour away!

00:11:44.444 --> 00:11:48.144
He'll ruin every world heritage
site in the next 30 minutes!

00:11:48.144 --> 00:11:51.374
Wh-What do we do, Minamoto?!

00:11:55.484 --> 00:11:59.484
Hello! Aoi? I was wrong! Please, come back!

00:11:59.794 --> 00:12:01.964
God! Men are so selfish!

00:12:01.964 --> 00:12:04.324
You only call when you need something!

00:12:04.964 --> 00:12:05.724
Aoi!

00:12:05.934 --> 00:12:09.604
Don't get the wrong idea. I didn't come for you.

00:12:09.604 --> 00:12:12.194
I just came to protect my beautiful Kyoto.

00:12:12.474 --> 00:12:15.274
Oh! A Japanese tsundere! I love this!

00:12:15.274 --> 00:12:16.104
Shut up!
Oh! A Japanese tsundere! I love this!

00:12:16.514 --> 00:12:17.944
Aoi, we have no time!

00:12:20.814 --> 00:12:23.874
The Children, Aoi Nogami, released!

00:12:25.154 --> 00:12:26.284
Some pickled leeks?

00:12:26.284 --> 00:12:27.454
Sure! I'll have some!

00:12:27.454 --> 00:12:28.924
Why?

00:12:29.454 --> 00:12:31.724
Isn't it great? Isn't it great?

00:12:31.724 --> 00:12:33.924
Oh, Magistrate!

00:12:38.194 --> 00:12:40.664
Now, what shall I express here?

00:12:40.664 --> 00:12:43.774
I use my ESP to make world
heritage sites my canvas!

00:12:43.774 --> 00:12:46.544
It's the ultimate in personal expression!

00:12:46.544 --> 00:12:47.774
Do your best!

00:12:47.774 --> 00:12:49.134
Not so fast!

00:12:52.744 --> 00:12:56.374
Absolutely Lovely Children
Aoi Nogami has arrived!

00:12:57.184 --> 00:12:58.274
A teleporter?

00:12:58.454 --> 00:13:00.684
What's the idea, coming into
my hometown and doing this?

00:13:00.684 --> 00:13:02.744
I won't let you get away with this!

00:13:03.994 --> 00:13:07.564
A Japanese special esper, huh?
All alone, little girl?

00:13:07.564 --> 00:13:09.684
We'll see about that.

00:13:10.334 --> 00:13:11.954
I'm counting on you, Mr. Minamoto.

00:13:12.364 --> 00:13:13.934
He's also a teleporter.

00:13:13.934 --> 00:13:16.694
She can interfere with him,
but can't finish him off.

00:13:16.934 --> 00:13:19.074
Leave it to me.

00:13:19.074 --> 00:13:22.434
This is valuable world heritage site.
Whatever you do, don't miss, Ken!

00:13:22.804 --> 00:13:26.744
I can see all the way to Tokyo
if I set my mind to it.

00:13:26.744 --> 00:13:29.514
So I have no doubts about my marksmanship.

00:13:29.514 --> 00:13:31.314
Clairvoyance, activate!

00:13:33.924 --> 00:13:37.944
Whoops! I'm overdoing it! I really can see Tokyo!

00:13:38.254 --> 00:13:40.224
I can't see any thing nearby!

00:13:40.224 --> 00:13:42.054
Focus back to here then, you idiot!

00:13:42.124 --> 00:13:43.194
What are you doing?!

00:13:43.194 --> 00:13:46.394
You aren't my only enemy here, are you?

00:13:46.734 --> 00:13:49.864
Nobody can stop me from
performing my art, can they?!

00:13:49.934 --> 00:13:53.034
Oh, please! What art? You're a vandal!

00:13:53.034 --> 00:13:55.304
How dare you insult Clyde!

00:13:55.304 --> 00:13:56.204
Don't move!

00:14:00.544 --> 00:14:01.614
Adhesive?!

00:14:01.614 --> 00:14:04.014
Shit! It's her trick!

00:14:04.014 --> 00:14:06.784
I'm not just a teleporter, am I?

00:14:06.784 --> 00:14:11.154
I'm a true artist, so I'm gifted
with many talents, aren't I?!

00:14:11.154 --> 00:14:13.714
Awesome! You're the best Clyde!

00:14:14.164 --> 00:14:17.064
Huh? She's flat! So thin!

00:14:17.064 --> 00:14:19.294
That woman is just a sketch
he made from paints!

00:14:19.294 --> 00:14:21.364
Does he move her with psychokinesis?

00:14:21.364 --> 00:14:23.774
I don't move her, do I?

00:14:23.774 --> 00:14:27.504
She is a being given life by a
true artist like me, isn't she?!

00:14:27.844 --> 00:14:29.674
Right! You're the best, Clyde!

00:14:29.774 --> 00:14:32.834
He's using ventriloquism. You can just
barely see his mustache moving.

00:14:32.974 --> 00:14:35.274
Aoi, if he's using psychokinesis
to move her, then...

00:14:35.344 --> 00:14:36.074
Silence!

00:14:39.284 --> 00:14:40.184
Mr. Minamoto!

00:14:40.254 --> 00:14:41.814
Now it's one on one, isn't it?!

00:14:41.884 --> 00:14:43.794
If you're going to stop us, then try to do it!

00:14:43.794 --> 00:14:46.484
Don't insult me! I'll knock you so
far away you'll never get back!

00:14:47.364 --> 00:14:48.164
Teleported?

00:14:48.164 --> 00:14:50.324
Fast enough to block me?

00:14:50.864 --> 00:14:52.124
Nope!

00:14:53.604 --> 00:14:55.294
It's a feint, isn't it?

00:14:55.534 --> 00:14:56.834
Take this!

00:14:58.074 --> 00:15:00.174
My eyes! I can't see anything!

00:15:00.174 --> 00:15:02.644
I've won, haven't I?!

00:15:09.084 --> 00:15:11.684
Minamoto! Minamoto!

00:15:11.684 --> 00:15:13.884
Oh! Wake up!

00:15:18.354 --> 00:15:19.054
Aoi!

00:15:21.394 --> 00:15:22.254
Mr. Minamoto?

00:15:23.394 --> 00:15:28.134
I was going to teleport this off, but I
can't without taking my eyelids with it.

00:15:28.134 --> 00:15:30.304
That guy got away.

00:15:30.304 --> 00:15:31.074
Aoi...

00:15:31.074 --> 00:15:32.564
He's at Kinpaku-ji!

00:15:32.674 --> 00:15:33.224
Ken!

00:15:33.304 --> 00:15:36.404
I've got him focused clearly now!

00:15:36.614 --> 00:15:40.144
Even if she can't see, if we can transmit
my clairvoyant images to her, then!

00:15:40.144 --> 00:15:41.374
But we don't have a telepath!

00:15:41.784 --> 00:15:45.514
If we don't do something, all the world
heritage sites will be destroyed!

00:15:45.514 --> 00:15:49.524
It's no use. I was so stupid and overconfident,

00:15:49.524 --> 00:15:51.924
but I couldn't even handle that one guy.

00:15:51.924 --> 00:15:55.324
I'm useless by myself.
Without Kaoru and Shiho, I'm!

00:15:58.294 --> 00:16:02.594
Aoi, you accomplished that mission
on your own before, didn't you?

00:16:04.374 --> 00:16:06.964
A black mark for me is a black
mark for all of The Children.

00:16:07.844 --> 00:16:11.144
If I fail here, Kaoru and Shiho
will share my disgrace!

00:16:12.644 --> 00:16:14.274
But now my eyes are!

00:16:14.514 --> 00:16:17.004
Even if you can't see, you won't lose.

00:16:23.654 --> 00:16:27.664
Oh! This will make the best canvas, won't it?

00:16:27.664 --> 00:16:29.894
It's stimulating my creative vision to no end!

00:16:29.894 --> 00:16:31.264
Do it, Clyde!

00:16:31.264 --> 00:16:33.034
All right, let's get to it!

00:16:33.034 --> 00:16:34.594
No, you don't!

00:16:35.734 --> 00:16:38.204
Your stupid game is over!

00:16:38.204 --> 00:16:39.794
I'm ending this!

00:16:40.344 --> 00:16:44.644
How stubborn! But what can you
hope to do if you can't see?

00:16:44.644 --> 00:16:46.944
This time I'll block your nose and mouth, too!

00:16:49.114 --> 00:16:49.544
What?!

00:16:49.784 --> 00:16:50.874
Im-Impossible!

00:16:51.614 --> 00:16:54.454
How can you teleport so precisely
with your eyes covered?!

00:16:54.454 --> 00:16:56.384
Do you have other ESP powers
besides teleportation?!

00:16:56.654 --> 00:16:59.524
No, I'm just the best teleporter there is.

00:16:59.524 --> 00:17:03.154
And right now, I've got the best support
team to bring out everything I've got!

00:17:03.734 --> 00:17:06.634
Teleporters are the most advanced espers.

00:17:06.634 --> 00:17:10.124
Because they can truly sense a three
dimensional space and manipulate it.

00:17:10.404 --> 00:17:13.604
That intuition would be sharpest
in a Level 7 like you.

00:17:13.604 --> 00:17:16.044
But, since you normally see well
enough with just your eyes,

00:17:16.044 --> 00:17:17.874
you've become dependent
on your sense of sight.

00:17:18.274 --> 00:17:21.344
Trust your teleporter's intuition.

00:17:21.344 --> 00:17:22.744
If you do, then surely...

00:17:23.814 --> 00:17:26.914
It's just a fluke, isn't it?! It must be, right?!

00:17:31.854 --> 00:17:36.194
Trust your teleporter's intuition!

00:17:39.164 --> 00:17:42.154
Don't insult The Children!

00:17:49.574 --> 00:17:53.474
Using teleportation against a teleporter!
Clever, isn't it?!

00:17:55.514 --> 00:17:57.174
Crap!

00:17:57.414 --> 00:17:58.714
Payback!

00:17:58.714 --> 00:18:00.984
That just leaves his telekinesis.

00:18:01.224 --> 00:18:04.624
I'm sure it's limited to control over that adhesive.

00:18:04.624 --> 00:18:07.384
He'll probably detach it from his body to attack.

00:18:07.494 --> 00:18:09.254
Just ignore it and go for him directly!

00:18:18.304 --> 00:18:21.844
And that's what they call
beating you while blindfolded.

00:18:21.844 --> 00:18:22.734
Aoi!

00:18:23.374 --> 00:18:24.274
Mr. Minamoto!

00:18:24.344 --> 00:18:27.244
Shit! You've already taken him down?

00:18:27.244 --> 00:18:29.184
Mary! You came!

00:18:29.184 --> 00:18:33.814
With my hydrokinesis, a guy like this
would be a piece of cake!

00:18:35.084 --> 00:18:36.384
Good job, Aoi.

00:18:36.384 --> 00:18:37.584
Mr. Minamoto!

00:18:37.654 --> 00:18:40.144
I don't know what we'd have done without you.

00:18:40.464 --> 00:18:43.054
Good thing you came with us!

00:18:43.434 --> 00:18:45.454
There's no need to thank me.

00:18:47.564 --> 00:18:49.794
I won thanks to your support.

00:18:50.234 --> 00:18:50.864
Aoi.

00:18:51.804 --> 00:18:55.004
But how about a reward from Comerica?

00:18:55.004 --> 00:18:55.774
What?

00:18:56.304 --> 00:18:58.744
Major, I'm sorry to report this, but...

00:18:58.914 --> 00:19:01.584
Kyosuke, you're a genius
at not getting this game!

00:19:01.584 --> 00:19:03.814
You see, Clyde Barrow was...

00:19:03.814 --> 00:19:05.614
I SAID, DON'T TALK TO ME!

00:19:06.084 --> 00:19:08.244
Wait! You just wait!

00:19:08.554 --> 00:19:11.224
Really? Aoi did that?

00:19:11.224 --> 00:19:11.254
AOI'S VICTORY CELEBRATION
Defense of Kyoto
Really? Aoi did that?

00:19:11.254 --> 00:19:11.654
AOI'S VICTORY CELEBRATION
Defense of Kyoto

00:19:11.654 --> 00:19:14.494
AOI'S VICTORY CELEBRATION
Defense of Kyoto
Our withdrawn, unconfident little
girl has become so reliable.

00:19:14.494 --> 00:19:15.224
Our withdrawn, unconfident little
girl has become so reliable.

00:19:15.224 --> 00:19:16.714
Thanks to all of you.

00:19:17.134 --> 00:19:21.434
No, sir. Her strength and talent
comes from her parents.

00:19:22.534 --> 00:19:25.864
No, my work kept me busy when she was little.

00:19:26.434 --> 00:19:29.674
I'm ashamed to say I didn't notice
how lonely my child was.

00:19:30.214 --> 00:19:31.404
And then, one day...

00:19:31.744 --> 00:19:34.914
Yes, sir! I'll have it delivered by the deadline!

00:19:34.914 --> 00:19:35.904
Yes! Yes!

00:19:37.754 --> 00:19:39.044
What?

00:19:39.114 --> 00:19:41.114
Hey, Mister! Are you Aoi's daddy?

00:19:41.324 --> 00:19:42.954
You're the girls Aoi was with...

00:19:42.954 --> 00:19:44.054
Kaoru, we shouldn't!

00:19:44.054 --> 00:19:44.994
Did you came from Tokyo?
Kaoru, we shouldn't!

00:19:44.994 --> 00:19:45.954
Did you came from Tokyo?

00:19:45.954 --> 00:19:48.124
Mister, you love Aoi, don't you?!

00:19:48.794 --> 00:19:51.434
If you do... If you do, then!

00:19:51.434 --> 00:19:54.634
She's stupid! If you don't say it,
she'll never know it!

00:19:54.634 --> 00:19:56.764
She hates that you don't say it!

00:19:58.704 --> 00:19:59.674
Satisfied?

00:20:00.974 --> 00:20:02.774
We'll be in trouble if they find out we're gone!

00:20:03.144 --> 00:20:06.514
Sorry. She gets excited really easily.

00:20:06.514 --> 00:20:10.184
Aoi said she was sent to BABEL
because you didn't want her.

00:20:10.184 --> 00:20:14.674
I picked up that thought from her...
And accidentally said it out loud.

00:20:18.094 --> 00:20:20.114
She was lucky.

00:20:20.424 --> 00:20:22.554
To have met such good friends.

00:20:22.864 --> 00:20:25.464
Hey, Mr. President! Don't be so blue!

00:20:25.464 --> 00:20:27.294
Let me entertain you!

00:20:27.434 --> 00:20:28.764
Geisha maiko cosplay!

00:20:28.834 --> 00:20:31.374
Um, we don't normally hang
around with these two, so...

00:20:31.374 --> 00:20:34.704
Mr. Minamoto, look who finally showed up.

00:20:36.674 --> 00:20:40.574
Fujiko here. Sorry for oversleeping before.

00:20:40.744 --> 00:20:43.114
You! Can't you keep your promises?!
What do you mean, overslept?!

00:20:43.114 --> 00:20:45.514
Are you mad? Please don't be mad!
You! Can't you keep your promises?!
What do you mean, overslept?!

00:20:45.884 --> 00:20:46.954
She also...

00:20:46.954 --> 00:20:48.524
dragged us along.

00:20:48.524 --> 00:20:51.084
Oh! Three lovely ladies!

00:20:51.324 --> 00:20:54.154
Oh, I'm not THAT young, pretty, and sexy!

00:20:54.964 --> 00:20:57.094
Daddy gets a freebie from Fujiko for that!

00:20:57.094 --> 00:20:59.294
I will not be beaten in the bust size department!

00:20:59.864 --> 00:21:01.024
I'm not dreaming this, right?

00:21:02.534 --> 00:21:03.794
Huh? Where's Mom?

00:21:05.304 --> 00:21:08.204
In the next room looking at kimonos
with a salesman, it seems.

00:21:08.204 --> 00:21:10.504
She's about to choose a
semi-formal for 8 million yen.

00:21:12.144 --> 00:21:14.614
Dad! Mom's on another spending spree!

00:21:14.614 --> 00:21:16.684
Dammit, I got carried away!

00:21:16.684 --> 00:21:19.554
Stop! I was wrong!

00:21:19.854 --> 00:21:21.754
Thank you for buying.

00:21:21.754 --> 00:21:26.224
It's all right. You go have fun with those girls.

00:21:26.224 --> 00:21:29.094
I work out stress in my own way.

00:21:29.094 --> 00:21:30.154
Mercy!

00:21:30.494 --> 00:21:32.694
God, my parents are lame.

00:21:32.764 --> 00:21:33.924
Oh, don't say that.

00:21:34.364 --> 00:21:36.504
It's time to get back to Tokyo, huh?

00:21:36.504 --> 00:21:39.764
Well, there's no hurry... Take your time here.

00:21:39.974 --> 00:21:43.034
I don't feel like I've got you for myself anymore.

00:21:43.714 --> 00:21:46.274
And while my family's important to me,

00:21:46.374 --> 00:21:49.214
I don't think we should leave
those two alone for very long.

00:21:50.584 --> 00:21:54.154
What'll I do? I just wiped out Aoi's saved games.

00:21:54.154 --> 00:21:57.414
She's gonna be pissed. She's been
hooked on that game lately.

00:21:59.224 --> 00:22:01.154
It's almost ready!

00:22:01.324 --> 00:22:02.984
We'll blame Dr. Sakaki.

00:22:03.124 --> 00:22:04.824
Yes! Great idea!

00:22:21.384 --> 00:22:26.114
I embraced your boasting tight

00:22:26.114 --> 00:22:29.054
Even everything about your sad profile

00:22:29.054 --> 00:22:31.424
I love

00:22:31.424 --> 00:22:35.624
Girl who gets stronger with
every wall she breaks

00:22:35.624 --> 00:22:41.494
My eyes will never wander from you

00:22:41.804 --> 00:22:46.804
Because these too-honest feelings in my heart

00:22:46.804 --> 00:22:50.344
Can't be beaten by anyone

00:22:50.344 --> 00:22:53.514
I absolutely will never let you go

00:22:53.514 --> 00:22:55.614
No matter when or why

00:22:55.614 --> 00:23:00.824
And I'll change that still-unseen last scene

00:23:00.824 --> 00:23:05.154
Devils and angels both have wings

00:23:05.154 --> 00:23:10.794
So let's aim for higher skies

00:23:10.794 --> 00:23:15.504
Don't let your smile be clouded anymore

00:23:15.504 --> 00:23:18.104
When the hopes that connect us now

00:23:18.104 --> 00:23:21.874
Rip the darkness apart

00:23:21.874 --> 00:23:24.804
Together, you and I

00:23:25.044 --> 00:23:30.674
Will fly towards the future, Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.864 --> 00:23:41.164
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.164 --> 00:23:41.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.964 --> 00:23:43.654
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:44.394 --> 00:23:48.834
I finally get leave, so why do I have to
babysit these totally uncute little brats?

00:23:48.834 --> 00:23:50.474
Shut up, Dr. Sakaki!

00:23:50.474 --> 00:23:51.864
You don't have to come.

00:23:52.274 --> 00:23:55.034
Why is Mr. Minamoto friends with a guy like this?

00:23:55.204 --> 00:23:58.414
I can't believe how Minamoto
dotes on these girls.

00:23:58.414 --> 00:23:59.904
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:00.014 --> 00:24:03.284
Episode 32: "A Rare Treat!
Touch Me If You Can!"

00:24:03.284 --> 00:24:04.884
I'll be showing up too, so you can all relax.

00:24:04.884 --> 00:24:06.614
Oh, and so will Mr. Minamoto.

00:24:06.614 --> 00:24:06.714
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.714 --> 00:24:08.954
A Rare Treat!
Touch Me If You Can!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.954 --> 00:24:09.944
A Rare Treat!
Touch Me If You Can!
